CM_ BO_ 2158743023 "Packet 1: pack voltage, current, state, alerts. Id = BMS id (example ABCDEF).";
CM_ SG_ 2158743023 Load_Status "Spec: 'Load Status = State & 0x28' - modelled as bits 3..5 of D0; verify with the BMS.";
CM_ BO_ 2209074671 "Packets 2-7: responses on the request id, D0 = command. Requests (DLC 1, D0 = command) and the FET control request (D1 Dsg FET, D2 Chg FET: 0 no change / 1 off / 2 on) use the same id. SOH/SOC byte positions follow the spec table order (D1, D2).";
CM_ SG_ 2209074671 Temp_Info_D1 "D1 of the temperature response (01 in the spec example).";
